Package: suez
Type: Package
Title: Molecular response QTL mapping
Version: 0.5
Date: 2017-09-28
Author: David A. Knowles
Maintainer: David A. Knowles <knowles84@gmail.com>
Description: Maps expression QTLs and genotype x condition (response) eQTLs with linear mixed models that
    account for repeated samples, relatedness and hidden confounders, extending the PANAMA approach to
    repeat measurements and multiple conditions (with optional local-ancestry models for admixed samples).
License: GPL (>=3)
Depends: R (>= 3.0.2), Rcpp (>= 0.12.12), methods
Imports: rstan (>= 2.26.0),
	 rstantools (>= 1.3.0),
	 dplyr,
	 magrittr, 
	 doMC,
	 foreach,
	 readr,
	 stats,
	 utils
Suggests: VariantAnnotation, GenomicRanges, IRanges, Rsamtools, edgeR, knitr, rmarkdown
VignetteBuilder: knitr
LinkingTo: StanHeaders (>= 2.26.0), rstan (>= 2.26.0), BH (>= 1.65.0.1), Rcpp (>= 0.12.12), RcppEigen (>= 0.3.3.3.0), RcppParallel
RoxygenNote: 7.1.0
NeedsCompilation: yes
SystemRequirements: GNU make
Encoding: UTF-8
